<title>USA: American Phoenix declares note defaults.</title>
<headline>American Phoenix declares note defaults.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Phoenix Group Inc said on Friday it declared Capital Finance Corp and Budbox Inc in default on promissory notes, and has filed suits against both these companies.</p>
<p>American Phoenix said Capital Finance has had several extensions to pay a balance of $8.1 million on notes and Budbox has had several extensions to pay a balance of $1 million.</p>
<p>American Phoenix said it will create a partial reserve of $4.1 million against potential future losses.</p>
<p>The company also said that on May 20 it will change its name to TAL Wireless Networks Inc.</p>
</text>
